{"siren:The pilot appears to have widened access to evening classes, although the headline attendance figure conceals substantial variation between districts. Participants who completed the course reported greater confidence; those who withdrew were not surveyed. Extending the programme may therefore be justified as an access measure, but claims about its educational impact would be premature. A revised evaluation should distinguish participation from sustained learning and include the experiences of those who left.":"117c791baca8326d8cd2bfc33d245b4f7d85150d4c8f3e2dfb44cac2cb7a3f4a"}